flowchart TD
    Home([Home]) --> Role[Role Selection]
    Role --> Begin[Begin Interview]
    Begin --> Load[Load Question]
    Load --> Timer[Start 60-Second Timer]
    Timer --> Answer[User Types Answer]
    Answer --> Submit[Manual Submit / Timer Reaches 0]
    Submit --> Eval[Evaluate Answer]
    Eval --> Feedback[Show Feedback]
    Feedback --> More{More Questions?}
    More -- YES --> Next[Next Question]
    Next --> Load
    More -- NO --> Results([Results])
